NSM Semantic Primes and Molecules
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The Natural Semantic Metalanguage primes and molecules are based on the
  canonical inventory described in:

    Goddard, C. & Wierzbicka, A. (2014). Words and Meanings: Lexical
    Semantics Across Domains, Languages, and Cultures. Oxford University Press.

    Goddard, C. (2010). Semantic molecules and semantic complexity.
    Review of Cognitive Linguistics, 8(1), 123–155.

  These are referenced for scholarly purposes; the coding of primes and
  molecules in nsm_primes.py and nsm_molecules.py is original work by the
  project authors.

